				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				173,
				1
			],
			"Message": "chore(Deps): Format CHANGELOG.md with standard text wrapping\n\nReflow the introductory paragraphs and list items in Land/Dependency/CHANGELOG.md to conform to standard 72-character line wrapping and consistent paragraph spacing.\n\nThe changes are purely cosmetic, removing hard line breaks from narrative text while preserving the structured version history and commit references. This ensures the documentation is readable in standard terminal viewers and adheres to project formatting standards.",
